# runtime output dirs — root-anchored so nested source dirs named the same
# (e.g. apps/web/src/features/runs/) stay tracked (PA-1R recheck 032 blocker).
/runs/
mlruns/
*.log
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
/artifacts/
# content-addressed artifact store of an in-memory composition
# (`services/api/assembly.py` resolves it next to the DB, i.e. the repo root
# when the DB is `:memory:`); runtime bytes, never source.
/artifact-blobs/
# local scratch space: ad-hoc debug scripts and throwaway databases.
# Audit probes cited by rechecks live in tools/probes/ and are tracked.
scratch/
# other agent tools' local state (not Research OS engineering assets)
.freebuff/
.workbuddy/
# local agent-tool state (security scans / CLI sessions) — not engineering assets
.mimosa/
.zcode/
docs/history-session
# Playwright e2e transient artifacts (baselines live in *-snapshots dirs)
apps/web/test-results/
.venv_ppocr/